#==============================================================================================
#
#   palette_2 - Palette: the named accessors of the theme
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibGfx/Palette.h (lines 58-200): Palette's inline members, the
#       one-line accessors of each color, alignment, flag, metric and path role, the
#       forwarding color/alignment/flag/metric/path, theme() and impl().
#
#==============================================================================================

